    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Tempo (39min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 10min from 40% to 73% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 86% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 53% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 89% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 53% FTP | Steady: 6min @ 80% FTP | Cooldown: 5min from 40% to 60% FTP</description>
